                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Fol. 1a. The five pillars of mystery. Same text and division as in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/TAfait031">Tel Aviv, Tel Aviv University Sourasky Central Library, Faitlovich 31</ref>. -- 76a. The story of creation. Same text as in nanuscript No.31 -- 111a. The Teachings of faith (Haymanot Tamaru) -- 130b. Adhortations from the Scriptures (Mi'idan), collected by "seven learned monks" -- 159a. Church Ordinance (Yaserata beta kristiyan na gar).
                        </summary>

                        
