                        <additions><list><item xml:id="a1"><desc>2 fly-leaves at the beginning and one at the end. On the verso of the first fly-leaf, a later hand has added a short biography of Abba Tarbu, who was put into prison by Diocletian on account of his Christian faith and liberated by Constantin. On the recto of the second fly-leaf, another hand has added a summary of the contents of the manuscript</desc></item></list></additions>
